{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418892-flurry-optimisation","id":1418892,"title":"Flurry Optimisation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-18T14:42:12-07:00","id":1418892,"title":"Flurry Optimisation","content":"So, we have the Quick Draw and Multiple Limbs feats, and Shield as a weapon. What else from evocations, charms, other feats and anything else really that can enhance or provide extra options to flurry?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26228-infinity_master","name":"Infinity_Master","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26228_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T15:55:51-07:00","id":1418900,"title":"","content":"Poised Lion Attitude in <i>Miracles of the Solar Exalted</i> gives you the ability to flurry social actions and combat actions together at no penalty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T00:37:50-07:00","id":1418954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Infinity_Master</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418892-flurry-optimisation#post1418892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, we have the Quick Draw and Multiple Limbs feats, and Shield as a weapon. What else from evocations, charms, other feats and anything else really that can enhance or provide extra options to flurry?</div> </div> </div> </div>Solar Charms: <br /> <br /> Athletics: Godspeed Steps - Removes the flurry penalty for rushes<br /> <br /> Performance: Thousand Courtesan Ways - tack a free sexy effect on your social rolls.<br /> <br /> Presence: Terrifying Apparition of Glory - Reflexive threaten action every turn for a scene<br /> <br /> Martial Arts<br /> <br /> Silver Voiced Nightingale: Voice of the Night Bird - Flurry social actions with attacks without penalty<br /> <br /> NPC Charms (see also Yasal Crystal)<br /> <br /> Principle of Motion - Take two actions ignoring normal flurry restrictions<br /> <br /> NPC Merits<br /> <br /> Dual Strikes - Flurry two different attacks<br /> <br /> Ferocious Cub Guardian: Bonuses to defend other, including ignoring the flurry defence penalty<br /> <br /> Loyal Guardian: Ignore defence penalty for flurrying","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 10-25-2020, 05:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T00:53:21-07:00","id":1418958,"title":"","content":"Dragonblooded have one in the brawl water sig to flurry physical actions with no penalty<br /> <br /> A presence one to do the same for social influence<br /> <br /> Performance to flurry movement actions with no penalty<br /> <br /> A ride charm to flurry disengage with no penalty<br /> <br /> A war charm to flurry command rolls<br /> <br /> An archery charm that lets you flurry an aim with movement<br /> <br /> Air dragon lets you flurry a disengage with no penalty, even with an aim action<br /> <br /> Water dragon lets you flurry an attack and defence<br /> <br /> White veil lets you flurry socialize actions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T03:43:15-07:00","id":1418978,"title":"","content":"Natural Shield ** mutation in lunars that's like a shield tag weapon but you don't take defence penalties for flurrying full defense. <br /> <br /> Lunars also have an Int charm for flurrying Shape Sorcery with reduced or no flurry penalties, and a Dex charm that lets them flurry 3 actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2579-limaxophobiac","name":"limaxophobiac","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"294"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T05:15:27-07:00","id":1418992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418892-flurry-optimisation?p=1418900#post1418900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Poised Lion Attitude in <i>Miracles of the Solar Exalted</i> gives you the ability to flurry social actions and combat actions together at no penalty.</div> </div> </div> </div>Poised Lion is much better than that, it bypasses flurry entirely and gives you a reflexive social action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T18:15:36-07:00","id":1420053,"title":"","content":"Soulfarer from Arms of the Chosen has an evocation to flurry an attack with a shape sorcery action.<br /> <br /> Single Point Shining Into the Void Form isn't a flurry, but does let you essentially combine any action with an attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T09:50:48-07:00","id":1420281,"title":"","content":"A few more from WFHW:<br /> <br /> DB Performance has quite a few charms that allow you to flurry continuing a magical performance that does something useful with another action, like Harmonious Life-Affirming Song, which speeds healing, or Mesmerizing Siren Call, which conjures illusions. It's a theme of the whole tree.<br /> <br /> The Matchmaker\u2019s Cockerel Stride from Imprimatur lets you flurry a full defence with disengage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24647,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","user":"Moss Reynholm","date":". 10-26-2020, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T10:00:43-07:00","id":1420285,"title":"","content":"From Heirs (not fully available yet):<br /> <br /> Dragon-Dancer's Wings (Typhoon Fangs) lets you flurry a full defense with a Performance action with no penalty.<br /> <br /> Sunset Blaze (Dire Lance) boosts Roaring Dragon Officer and its ability to flurry commands.<br /> <br /> Seralawi (Gunzosha Armour) has an evocation that lets you flurry a full defense with a defend other while ignoring penalties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T18:04:02-07:00","id":1420363,"title":"","content":"Since someone else just mentioned it in another thread... For the low low price of a yasal crystal you too can have Principle of Motion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T18:25:03-07:00","id":1420368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1418892-flurry-optimisation?p=1420363#post1420363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since someone else just mentioned it in another thread... For the low low price of a yasal crystal you too can have Principle of Motion.</div> </div> </div> </div>5 (Blood Ape) or 6 (Agata) guilt free flurries per day is pretty neat.<br /> <br /> You also need sorcery if you want to bypass that entire \u201cangry demons\u201d bit though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}